            "caption": "I let my students use AI. Then I put a debate timer on the desk. In my strategy classes, every case is a debate. Each team gets 10 minutes to present. Then 10 minutes to plan a rebuttal, and 10 minutes each to question it. A group I call the first responders checks the data and the assumptions. The whole class scores a rubric and votes for the winner. One more rule. If nobody asks the big question and I have to ask it, everyone loses participation points for the day. AI can help with the write-up. It cannot stand at the front of the room for you. How are you checking what your students or your team really know? #TeachingWithAI #AIforEducation #CaseMethod #HigherEd #professorlife   ",
